msgid "Loadings"
msgstr "Ladingen"

msgid ""
"Factor loadings and their moderation effects. Significant moderation effects "
"indicate that the relationship between the latent factor and its indicator "
"varies across levels of the moderator (metric non-invariance)."
msgstr "Factorladingen en hun moderatie-effecten. Significante moderatie-effecten geven aan dat de relatie tussen de latente factor en zijn indicator varieert over de niveaus van de moderator (metrische non-invariantie)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Factor"
